_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ec7ff6b8766fb2fcEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_ElderBrainIntellect</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_ElderBrainIntellect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_ElderBrainIntellect\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e90f131c-b64e-4789-b2b4-399c9abe5537</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e90f131c-b64e-4789-b2b4-399c9abe5537\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e90f131c-b64e-4789-b2b4-399c9abe5537\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Gortash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gortash\">Enver Gortash's</a> office on the top floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a>, on the long table in the centre of the room</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>A report for Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash</a> by Scribe Yanthus \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>An illithid elder brain is many things: absolute ruler of its <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">mind flayer colony</a>, fount of procreation through its production of illithid larvae, the so-called 'tadpoles', but most of all an elder brain is a supremely powerful organic calculator, a mental machine able to process a vast number of simultaneous thought processes. It is always a hundred moves ahead, and cannot be surprised except by a sudden confluence of unexpected variables. Mortal genius and innovation are no match for its sheer computational power. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[Below this, a note is appended in Gortash's precise handwriting.] \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>No weakness but the unexpected. It seems I shall need unexpected allies.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715033714\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1340/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26367/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7923/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931205/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.149      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.149      1 -total\n 48.89%   20.605      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.73%   18.430     15 Template:Trim\n 23.70%    9.988      2 Template:Uid\n 16.59%    6.992      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.35%    5.625      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.33%    4.77